  "_provenance": [
    "PARTIAL LIST, and not from the issuer.",
    "",
    "תו הזהב is issued by Shufersal and is accepted well beyond Shufersal itself — the",
    "issuer's own marketing says 'more than 90 chains'. Shufersal used to publish a",
    "partners page at www1.shufersal.co.il/Supersol_He/Tav_Hazahav/Categories/Partners/;",
    "as of 2026-08-01 that URL 301-redirects to the shop homepage, and no machine-readable",
    "list is published anywhere the app can reach. So this was compiled on 2026-08-01 from",
    "published third-party lists rather than from Shufersal.",
    "",
    "The chains below marked as corroborated appear in at least two independent sources",
    "(pay2.co.il's list, poenta.co.il's voucher comparison, and the Chamber of Commerce",
    "and Victory writeups). The long tail comes from pay2.co.il alone.",
    "",
    "This matters for what the app may claim. Everywhere else a list is either the issuer's",
    "own or scraped from the issuer's site, so 'listed means accepted' holds. Here it does",
    "not hold with the same force: a chain could have left the scheme since these pages were",
    "written. The list is flagged partial, which makes the UI say the list is incomplete and",
    "refuse to tell anyone their card is not accepted.",
    "",
    "Restaurants are deliberately excluded. Shufersal runs restaurant redemption through a",
    "Cibus tie-up covering roughly 100 individual restaurants rather than chains, the",
    "published names are single branches ('משייה ת\"א'), and they turn over far faster than",
    "retail. A stale restaurant list is worse than none at a checkout counter."
  ],
